sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant C as Coach tab (Nong Kla)
  participant B as domain/coach + buddy
  participant F as Edge Function coach
  participant AI as Gemini
  U->>C: Open coach / ask "Can I spend 500 today?"
  C->>B: buildInsights + buildCoachContext
